@base = http://localhost:3300

### Cadastrar usuário
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana", "email": "ana@email.com", "password": "1234" }

### Login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@email.com", "password": "1234" }

### Cadastrar pet
POST {{base}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Mel", "raca": "Poodle", "idade": 3, "tipo": "Cão", "cor": "Branca", "idU": 1 }

### Listar pets do usuário
GET {{base}}/user/1/pets

### Criar agendamento
POST {{base}}/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idU": 1, "petId": 1, "servico": "Banho", "data": "2026-12-01" }

### Listar agendamentos do usuário
GET {{base}}/user/1/agendamento
